{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan written. Correction to the original report: amazon.nova DOES cache prompts on Bedrock (bedrock_supports_prompt_caching=True in pydantic-ai 1.107.9), so it is not affected; the non-caching vendors are mistral, cohere, deepseek, openai-on-Bedrock, qwen, google, minimax, nvidia, meta and unknown ones."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794481949773725001,"uuid":"ab4f37ce-03e9-464c-bd2a-a372557d9b15"}